<title>SINGAPORE: Liang Huat secures contracts.</title>
<headline>Liang Huat secures contracts.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liang Huat Aluminium Ltd said on Thursday it had secured a Singapore $17.8 million contract in Singapore and a US$3 million contract in China.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the Singapore contract was for upgrading the facade of a building in the business district. It said the project was expected to be completed by the third quarter of 1998.</p>
<p>The China contract was for curtain walling the Pidemco Tower building in Shanghai.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
